    "section_rich_text_7XbMG6": {
      "type": "section-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_iFjgpq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>2. Podcast Studio Design for Darbar Arts & heritage trust</h4>",
            "text_size": 4,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 20
          }
        },
        "text_TbRMpQ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our bespoke podcast studio design for <strong>Darbar Arts & Heritage Trust</strong> in London was finalised this month, curating an acoustically optimised, visually brand-adaptable media room. With studio-grade lighting, neutral wall colours, and adaptable branding zones, the space supports video podcasting and content creation for multiple users.</p><p>This podcast room isn’t just a box with sound panels. It’s a <strong>professional-grade, fully branded, acoustically designed</strong> space that:</p><p></p><p></p><p>༶ Records studio-quality audio</p><p>༶ Looks powerful on camera</p><p>༶ Flexes for new users and brands</p><p>༶ Supports Darbar’s mission to elevate Indian Classical Music in the UK</p><p>It proves that with the right strategy, small spaces can deliver big impact.</p>",
            "text_size": 3,
            "text_style": "font-body",
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        },
        "buttons_WkrR3H": {
          "type": "buttons",
          "settings": {
            "button_text": "Explore the Case study",
            "button_url": "shopify://blogs/blog/podcast-room-design-darbar",
            "button_type": "btn--secondary",
            "button_size": "",
            "button_style": "btn--solid",
            "show_arrow": true,
            "padding_bottom": 16
          }
        }
      },
