        "text_maq399": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We were thrilled to host <strong>Allsfar</strong>, acoustic furniture and partition specialists, at our Leicester studio. Their visit gave us hands-on experience with new samples and products, ideal for integrating sustainability and acoustic control into our commercial projects. </p><p>Their curated sample box will be featuring heavily in upcoming design schemes.</p>",
